{"format":1,"key":"zone:ashenvale","path":"/lore/zone/ashenvale","name":"Ashenvale","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"ashenvale","name":"Ashenvale","path":"/lore/zone/ashenvale"},"levels":"Levels 18-30","description":"Ashenvale's sacred woods are now a battleground as the Horde cuts timber for Orgrimmar. The ancient forest lies between the Barrens to the south and…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:ashenvale","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Ashenvale's sacred woods are now a battleground as the Horde cuts timber for Orgrimmar. The ancient forest lies between the Barrens to the south and Darkshore to the north, under the care of the Sentinels and Cenarius. Its canopy shelters moonwells and old ruins, alongside demonic blights, hostile tribes, and a contested frontier.","Beneath Mount Hyjal, Ashenvale has belonged to the kaldorei and the children of Cenarius for millennia. Immense trees form a close canopy, turning the daily rain to mist and leaving the forest floor in twilight. Moss covers the ruins of elven settlements, where walking ancients and dryads keep watch. For thousands of years, the night elves built no true cities here. They hunted lightly and kept the wild domain in balance.","The Third War broke Ashenvale's peace when Grommash Hellscream and the Warsong clan entered for lumber. Their demonic bloodlust led them to slay Cenarius. The struggle is now a full territorial war. From Splintertree Post and the southern Mor'shan Rampart, the Warsong Outriders send axes and shredders into the eastern woods to supply Orgrimmar. The Silverwing Sentinels hold Astranaar, a sanctuary town, and have sworn to drive every orcish logger from the sacred grove.","The lumber war is only one danger in Ashenvale. The Burning Legion left blighted scars at Felfire Hill and Demon Fall Canyon, where Mannoroth died. Satyrs use ruins such as Satyrnaar and Xavian as bases, corrupting waterways and wildlife. Furbolg tribes, once friends of the elves, have largely fallen to dark madness. Mysterious worgen stalk the northern shrine near Felwood, while cursed dragonkin prowl Bough Shadow and guard a portal into the troubled Emerald Dream."],"hash":"6d87ac","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"28bca93004","sec":103},"female-narrator":{"sha":"cce9dc7381","sec":109}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Ashenvale (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Ashenvale_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Ashenvale","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Ashenvale"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/zone/darkshore","n":"Darkshore","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/barrens","n":"The Barrens","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/blackfathom","n":"Blackfathom Deeps","k":"dungeon"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/astranaar","n":"Astranaar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/demon-fall-canyon","n":"Demon Fall Canyon","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bough-shadow","n":"Bough Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/mor-shan-rampart","n":"Mor'shan Rampart","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/twilight-grove","n":"Twilight Grove","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/94500-call-of-water","n":"Call of Water","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1842-satyr-hooves","n":"Satyr Hooves","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/item/uncloven-satyr-hoof","n":"Uncloven Satyr Hoof","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/topic/grommash-hellscream","n":"Grommash Hellscream","k":"topic"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/astranaar","n":"Astranaar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bathran-s-haunt","n":"Bathran's Haunt","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/blackfathom-deeps","n":"Blackfathom Deeps","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bloodtooth-camp","n":"Bloodtooth Camp","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bough-shadow","n":"Bough Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/demon-fall-canyon","n":"Demon Fall Canyon","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/demon-fall-ridge","n":"Demon Fall Ridge","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dor-danil-barrow-den","n":"Dor'Danil Barrow Den","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/falfar